OL,5,G0110 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FThis episode focuses on children
OL,7,     Fand parenthood. Louie, who's
OL,8,     Fthree, has been hit by a car.
OL,9,     FJosh, who's 14, injured his ankle
OL,10,     Fwhile riding a BMX with his dad.
OL,11,G0215 24 Hours in A&E
OL,12,     FDavid, who has type 1 diabetes,
OL,13,     Fhas infected toes. The medical
OL,14,     Fteam are worried that he faces
OL,15,     Famputation. Yvette has abrasions
OL,16,     Fto her eye after having false
OL,17,     Feyelashes fitted.
OL,18,G0320 The Perfect Pitch
OL,19,     FIn North Yorkshire, first host
OL,20,     FCarol sprinkles some magic at the
OL,21,     Ffantasy-themed glampsite North
OL,22,     FShire.
